BEHAVIOR floor

DESCRIPTION
  Largest integer <= x (mathematical floor), returned as an int. Truncation
  (FTOI) rounds toward zero; for a negative x with a fractional part that is
  one too high, so subtract the correction. floor(2.7)=2, floor(-2.3)=-3.

CONTRACT
  INPUT x float 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b6cfd5dd

IMPLEMENTATION
  xv = LOAD x 8
  t = FTOI xv 8 8
  tf = ITOF t 8 8
  gt = FGT tf xv 8
  r = ISUB t gt 8
  STORE result r 8
END
